  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Waking up alone in her Tokyo apartment beside a stack of unpaid bills, the young starlet answers an early morning call from her worried mother back on the family farm. Listen to the daughter and her mother in Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "おはよう、私。もしもし？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "resident",
      "t": "ああ、みく？昨日電話くれる約束だったでしょ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "ごめんごめん、起きてた？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "resident",
      "t": "とっくよ。うち農家なの、お忘れ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "resident",
      "t": "まったく、全然電話しないんだから。会社ちゃんと行ってるの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "行ってるってば。今ね、給料貯金して、",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "お母さんに旅行プレゼントしたいなって思ってんだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "resident",
      "t": "ありがとね、気持ちだけで十分よ。お金、大丈夫？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "大丈夫だよ、うちの会社、結構給料いいんだから。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "resident",
      "t": "勝手に東京行って、お父さんも心配してんだから、東京は危ない街だって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "危ないことなんかないから、大丈夫だよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "じゃあね、またかけるね。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "おはよう、私。もしもし？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Good morning, me. Hello?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "resident",
      "t": "ああ、みく？昨日電話くれる約束だったでしょ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, Miku? You promised you would phone me yesterday, didn't you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "ごめんごめん、起きてた？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sorry, sorry — were you already awake?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "resident",
      "t": "とっくよ。うち農家なの、お忘れ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Long ago! Have you forgotten our family runs a farm?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "resident",
      "t": "まったく、全然電話しないんだから。会社ちゃんと行ってるの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Honestly, you never call at all. Are you going to your company job properly?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "行ってるってば。今ね、給料貯金して、",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I told you I'm going! Right now I'm saving up my paycheck.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "お母さんに旅行プレゼントしたいなって思ってんだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'because I'd love to gift you a vacation trip, Mom.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "resident",
      "t": "ありがとね、気持ちだけで十分よ。お金、大丈夫？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you, sweetheart — the thought alone is plenty. Are you doing okay for money?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "大丈夫だよ、うちの会社、結構給料いいんだから。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'm totally fine — my company actually pays a pretty good salary.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "resident",
      "t": "勝手に東京行って、お父さんも心配してんだから、東京は危ない街だって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You ran off to Tokyo on your own, and your father worries it's a dangerous city.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "危ないことなんかないから、大丈夫だよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There's nothing dangerous at all here, so I'm fine.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "じゃあね、またかけるね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Bye for now — I'll call you again soon.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
